      "text": {
        "jp": "それならアタシは、あんたの首を\r\nぎゅーってしてあげるわよ。",
        "official_en": "How about I “snuggle” my hands tightly around your throat?",
        "real_en": "Then I'll give your neck a nice, tight squeeze."
