      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ただでさえ寒いのに、\r\n凍えるようなこと言わないでくれる？",
        "official_en": "I’ve already got the chills from the cold. I don’t need any more from disgust.",
        "real_en": "It's cold enough already. Could you not say things that make me shiver even more?"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
