      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "はっはっは。\r\nそんなに寒いなら俺の腕の中で温めてやるぜ。\r\nぎゅーってな。",
        "official_en": "Hahah! I know just the thing that’ll warm you right up. Why don’t we snuggle tight?",
        "real_en": "Hahaha! If you're that cold, I'll warm you up in my arms. Give you a tight squeeze!"
      },
